What the MIT license covers

The MIT license above covers the game's source code only: the GDScript, scenes, project
configuration, build scripts, workflows and website code.

Docs and original game content

The documentation in docs/ and the game's original creative content (art, sprites,
animations, fish and character designs, music, sound and in-game writing) are licensed
under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
License (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0), the same license as the #HusbandOutWorld source files:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

